qemu-arm: build the abboot example hooks

Builds board/emulation/qemu-arm/abboot-qemu.c (boards/qemu-arm64/abboot-qemu.c, copied there by
uboot/install.sh --example-board) when CONFIG_ABBOOT is set.

Against U-Boot v2026.10. SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later

diff --git a/board/emulation/qemu-arm/Makefile b/board/emulation/qemu-arm/Makefile
index a22d1237..bcfbcacd 100644
--- a/board/emulation/qemu-arm/Makefile
+++ b/board/emulation/qemu-arm/Makefile
@@ -1,3 +1,6 @@
 # SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0+
 
 obj-y	+= qemu-arm.o
+
+# The abboot example hooks (boards/qemu-arm64/abboot-qemu.c, copied here by uboot/install.sh)
+obj-$(CONFIG_ABBOOT) += abboot-qemu.o
